This project imports transactions from Monzo to Lunchmoney using their respective APIs.  It's written in Elixir.

The lunchmoney API is at https://lunchmoney.dev/
The Monzo API is at https://docs.monzo.com/

Run tests with `mix test`.

We have four top-level contexts in the lib folder:

- lunch_money - code specific to lunch money API
- monzo - code specific to monzo API
- lunch_money_sync - business logic for our app
- lunch_money_sync_web - web interfact for lunch_money sync
